rned against speculation and imposed fresh measures to contain volatility. \par \par \uc2  It also said it will sell dollars through the SBI to meet \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs for oil imports and some government debt payments. \par \par \uc2  Forwards premia rose despite easy call money rates on reporting day amid paying pressure from importers after the spot rupee weakened. \par \par \uc2  The six monthly forward premia annualised was at 2.62 percent compared to the previous close of 2.50 percent. \par \par \uc2  ((Bombay newsroom, +91 22 265-9000, fax +91 22 264-1699, anirban.nag@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw62048tg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
