r \par \par \uc2  against Thursday's close of 43.51/515 \par \par \uc2      * Forward premiums seen ranged between corporates' paying \par \par \uc2  (sell-buy swaps) to roll over month-end import contracts \par \par \uc2  expected to ease and receiving by state-run banks, which \par \par \uc2  dealers say is at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's behest. \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended the weekend at an annualised \par \par \uc2  4.93 percent compared with the previous 4.89 percent. \par \par \uc2      * India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the \par \par \uc2  wholesale price index fell to 1.56 percent in the week ended \par \par \uc2  August 14 from 1.70 percent in the previous week, the Industry \par \par \uc2  Ministry said on Sunday.. \par \par \uc2      Closing rates at weekend: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Call money rates\tab \tab   : 8.75/9.00 pct\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Pakistan rupee kerb closing   : 54.05/54.15\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Bombay Stock index\tab \tab   : 4,870.66 (+24.3)\par     Dow Jones Indust. Avg\tab      : 11,090.17 (-108.28)\par     Hang Seng Index\tab \tab      : 13,383.13 (-225.25)\par     Nikkei 225 Index\tab \tab     : 17,599.37 (-66.92)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   ((Bombay newsroom, +91 22 265-9000 fax +91 22 264-1699,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8u01oly\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
