\par\par \b \uc2  India rupee seen weak on politics, RBI to guide. \b0\par\par\uc2 529 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 1999\par 18:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, April 14 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee is likely to open weaker on Thursday on political uncertainty, but a sharp fall is unlikely in a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market largely controlled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Indian President K.R. Narayanan on Wednesday asked Prime Minister Atal Behari Vajpayee to seek a parliamentary vote of confidence in his Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) led government after a meeting with opposition parties. He specified no timeframe for the vote. \par \par \uc2  The move came after the ruling coalition's second biggest partner, the All India Anna Dravida Munnetra Kazhagam, formally withdrew support for the government, after having kept the BJP on tenterhooks for some two weeks. \par \par \uc2  "Initially, the dollar will be bid tomorrow and we may see a test of 43 but that should be the limit," said P.H. Ramaswamy, country treasurer at Credit Lyonnais. \par \par \uc2  He was speaking after the opposition parties' meeting with Narayanan, but before the President announced his decision on the holding of a confidence vote in the government. \par \par \uc2  The rupee ended Tuesday at 42.74/75 per dollar, down from its previous close of 42.685/695 on dollar demand spurred by political uncertainty. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets were shut on Wednesday for a local holiday. \par \par \uc2  "There should be no significant impact on the money market which is mainly driven by liquidity of which there is plenty at the moment," Ramaswamy said. \par \par \uc2  "But looking beyond tomorrow, where the rupee goes depends whether some other party or group is able to form the government. If no one is able to get the required numbers and we need fresh elections, then we may see some significant volatility," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Otherwise, the market seems to have largely discounted the currrent uncertainty." \par \par \uc2  The rupee has weakened some 31 paise (0.31 rupee) or 0.73 percent over its fiscal year-end bid close of 42.43 on March 31. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expected the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the event of excess volatility. \par \par \uc2  "The RBI is sitting on huge \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and should easily be able to handle any volatility," said a chief dealer at one state-run bank. India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at a record $32.535 billion on April 1. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers say the RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  indirectly, through state-run banks, to regulate dollar supply in the market. \par \par \uc2  "Further, many corporates have hedged their exposures and I think we will not see the kind of panic buying we saw last year or during the Asian crisis," the chief dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "There is hardly any scope for speculation in our market and I cannot see inter-bank trades driving the rupee down very much," Ramaswamy said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has kept a tight rein on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation since the rupee struck an all-time low of 43.70 per dollar last August. \par \par \uc2  Banks are allowed to run limited overnight positions and importers cannot cancel and rebook foward cover. ((Giri Venkatesan, Bombay newsroom, +91 22 265-9000 fax +91 22 264-1699, Bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv4e032tm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
