\par\par \b \uc2  Political fears send Indian rupee to 7-month low. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Vidya Ranganathan \par \uc2 549 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 April 1999\par 14:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, April 6 (Reuters) - The rupee hit a seven-month low on Tuesday as fears India's coalition government will collapse prompted importers to cover their dollar needs, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost just over 0.5 percent, but in a market used to intra-day moves of less than five paise (0.05 rupees) the 25 paise drop to a close of 42.68/70 per dollar was a jolt to the system. \par \par \uc2  "A lot of corporates were caught uncovered and unprepared by the political developments," said Munish Saigal, controller of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Ranbaxy Laboratories . \par \par \uc2  The All India Anna Dravida Munnetra Kazhagam (AIADMK), the second largest partner in the coalition, said late on Monday that its two ministers would resign from the government and it would decide later whether to withdraw support for the coalition. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures introduced when the rupee struck an all time low of 43.70 last August have eradicated inter-bank speculation, but the cloud over the government shook importers out of their complacency, dealers said \par \par \uc2  Dealers saw the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stabilising under the watchful eye of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but also expected a gradual weakening to keep the rupee competitive against other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I expect a period of consolidation for the rupee. It may however slide to 44 by mid-May," Saigal said. \par \par \uc2  Some believed the decline had been set in train. \par \par \uc2  "Importers have been shaken out of their inertia. The rupee will be in a 42.80-43.0 range against the dollar soon," said N. Venkatramanan, country treasurer of American Express Bank. \par \par \uc2  There was no sign of Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the rupee dropped, but dealers were watching closely to gauge the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's attitude to a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said stock market movements could provide clues to the rupee's trend, as dealers watched the ebbs and flows of foreign portfolio investment in the wake of the coalition crisis. \par \par \uc2  The benchmark Bombay index slumped 4.53 percent on Monday, but recovered 1.42 percent to end at 3,569.47 on Tuesday as the market corrected. \par \par \uc2  The rupee had remained rock solid on Monday but caught a bearish backlash on Tuesday which at one point relegated it to a low of 42.78. \par \par \uc2  The decline accelerated on dwindling prospects that the Hindu nationalist government's estranged partner would decide to stay in the coalition after a lawmaker allied to the AIADMK said the party would vote against the government if a vote of confidence was called. \par \par \uc2  "A good indicator of where the rupee is headed is the stock market. Today the stock market has already recovered some of Monday's losses," said Alok Nandi, director at Delhi-based Apex \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Consultants. \par \par \uc2  Bond prices rose ahead of a bond auction later in the day, impervious to the turbulence in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity tightening has been the RBI's favoured weapon to check rupee depreciation, but while traders expect it to hold back interest rate reductions, the situation did not warrant a reversal of the recent cut in rates, they said. ((Bombay newsroom, +91 22 265-9000 fax +91 22 264-1699, Bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv4603mmd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
