t\uc2  down to INR42.28. As a result, some banks held on to their long positions over the weekend. The unwinding of these positions is expected to bring in some dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  These supplies can be expected to prop up the rupee, they added. However, it is not clear if the State Bank of India, under the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's instruction, will allow the rupee to move up too much, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  For latest indicative rupee rates please see Telerate page [26501]. \par \par \uc2  -By Ramya Venugopal; 91 22 2884211-18; rvenugopal@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0442GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duaq00gen\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
