\par\par \b \uc2  India Commerce Min/Barter Trade -2: Address In Singapore \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1998\par 10:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW DELHI (Dow Jones)--India favors barter trade to lessen its dependence on the U.S. dollar for key imports, Commerce Minister Ramakrishna Hegde said in Singapore Wednesday while addressing an India Day seminar. \par \par \uc2  In a report carried on Press Trust of India, Hegde was quoted as saying Southeast Asian nations should encourage barter trade as a way of avoiding dollar dependency. \par \par \uc2  "Members of the ASEAN (Association of Southeast Asian Nations) family should be able to have benefit of increased mutual trade with interference and over-dependence on one \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Hegde said. "For this, India would like to encourage trade on a barter basis." \par \par \uc2  Hegde's suggestion comes amid a steep fall in the rupee Wednesday with the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and restricting \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealings. \par \par \uc2  In a bid to tighten rupee liquidity, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has raised the cash reserves that banks must maintain as a ratio of their liabilities to 11% from 10%. This will become effective on Aug. 29. \par \par \uc2  It has also raised the rates at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell repurchase agreements of government bonds to 8% from 5% currently. The Reserve Bank didn't say when the new RP rate will take effect. \par \par \uc2  The rupee is currently trading at INR42.85 to the dollar, compared to a new record low level above INR43.00 to the dollar before the announcement. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened from INR42.50 in the last two weeks. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0826GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8k0737m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
