\par\par \b \uc2  India Rupee Dn Midday; Pft-Taking Pares Early Gains \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 1998\par 09:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee is lower in midday trading Monday, although profit-taking at lower levels has pared earlier losses, dealers said Monday. \par \par \uc2  At 0735 GMT (3:35 a.m. EDT), the dollar is trading at 42.69 rupee (INR), up from its previous close of INR42.20. The dollar had touched an intra-day high of INR42.85, but at that level profit-taking by banks improved the rupee. \par \par \uc2  The rupee fell sharply after Moody's Investors Service downgraded India's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  country ceiling Friday for long-term debt and notes to Ba2 from Baa3. \par \par \uc2  The downgrade will make it harder for Indian companies to borrow dollars abroad and also reduce foreign fund investment in Indian shares and bonds, thereby lowering dollar inflows. \par \par \uc2  "Banks are playing safe and are booking profits," a dealer at a U.S-based bank said. \par \par \uc2  The underlying fear in the market is that a sharp fall in the rupee may prompt the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and start selling dollars, he added. \par \par \uc2  Reserve Bank either \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly or else through the State Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the country's largest commercial bank, of which it owns 68%. \par \par \uc2  At the moment State Bank isn't supporting the rupee at any particular level, bankers added. \par \par \uc2  Rupee premiums on forward dollars are still higher, although they have slipped from their early highs, dealers said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupee premium on dollars to be delivered in November is at\par INR2.26, up from its previous close of INR1.97. The premium had touched\par a high of INR2.28.\par    -By S.Anuradha; (91 22) 288-4211;sanuradha@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0745GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6m05bq2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
