\par\par \b \uc2  India Rupee Ends At New Low On S&P Cuts But Pares Losses \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 1998\par 13:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee (INR) ended lower on hectic dollar-buying by banks and companies after rating agency Standard & Poor's downgraded the outlook on India's sovereign rating to negative from stable late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The rupee ended at 40.96, down from Friday's close of 40.66. The rupee touched an intraday low of INR41.20 on Monday but recovered on some profit-taking by banks and exporters. \par \par \uc2  The previous low of INR40.80 was touched on May 14 after the U.S. imposed economic sanctions on India following its nuclear test explosions. \par \par \uc2  As reported, Standard & Poor's have retained India's long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issuer credit rating of double-B-plus and its local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issuer credit rating of triple-B-plus, but changed the outlook on both ratings to negative from stable. \par \par \uc2  State Bank of India, the country's largest commercial bank, gave some early support to the rupee but withdrew once it realized that dollar demand was heavy, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "State Bank was buying dollars when it touched 41 but started selling at 41.20," a dealer at a European bank said. \par \par \uc2  The movement of the spot rupee is determined by the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or sales and purchases of the State Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank owns 68% in State Bank. The market believes that often the State Bank operates in the market on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 25-05-98 \par \par \uc2  1111GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5p04g2b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
