\par\par \b \uc2  India Rupee Midday -2: Demand For Dlrs Continues \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 1998\par 09:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee (INR) fell further and breached the INR41-level midday Monday on continued demand for dollars from banks and companies who fear the rupee will get weaker after Standard & Poor's downgraded the outlook on India's sovereign rating to negative from stable late Friday. \par \par \uc2  AT 0715 GMT (3:15 a.m. EDT), the rupee is at a record-low INR41.10, down from Friday's close of 40.66. The previous low of INR40.80 was touched on May 14 after the U.S. imposed economic sanctions on India following the nuclear test explosions. \par \par \uc2  As reported, Standard & Poor's have retained India's long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issuer credit rating of double-B-plus and its local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issuer credit rating of triple-B-plus, but changed the outlook on both ratings to negative from stable. \par \par \uc2  Lack of heavy dollar selling by State Bank of India, the country's largest commercial bank accelerated the fall. "There was some dollar selling at INR40.94 by the State Bank, but it is keeping quiet seeing the heavy dollar demand," a dealer at private bank said. \par \par \uc2  The movement of the spot rupee is determined by the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or sales and purchases of the State Bank. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank owns 68% in State Bank. The market believes that often the State Bank operates in the market on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By S.Anuradha; (91 22) 288-4211;sanuradha@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0733GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5p04fi4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
